---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
interface Props { locale: Locale; active?: 'legacy' | 'ceiling' | 'openevo2' | 'index' }
const { locale, active = 'index' } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn:string,en:string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path:string) => localePath(locale,path);
---
<section class="s2-choice" data-testid="stage2-strategy-selector" aria-labelledby="s2-choice-title">
  <div class="s2-choice__head">
    <p>OPENEVO · EXPERIMENT LINEAGE</p>
    <h2 id="s2-choice-title">{t('Stage 2 经历三次设计；OpenEVO 2.0 不重采当前 Stage 1','Three Stage-2 designs; OpenEVO 2.0 does not recollect the current Stage 1')}</h2>
    <span>{t('历史 256-window 方法保留为旧方法证据。Ceiling-1.0 修掉了“7 / 8 才准学”的硬门槛并正在运行；OpenEVO 2.0 则从当前 corrected Stage-1 证据继续，在经验如何组织、选择和进入 WebShop prompt 这一层重新设计。','The historical 256-window method remains as old-method evidence. Ceiling-1.0 removed the brittle 7/8 permission-to-learn gate and is running; OpenEVO 2.0 reuses the current corrected Stage-1 evidence and redesigns how experience is organized, selected, and delivered into the WebShop prompt.')}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="s2-choice__shared" aria-label={t('Ceiling-1.0 与 OpenEVO 2.0 的共同起点','Shared starting point for Ceiling-1.0 and OpenEVO 2.0')}>
    <div><span>SHARED INPUT</span><strong>{t('当前 corrected Stage 1','Current corrected Stage 1')}</strong><small>1,440 trajectories / arm</small></div>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 90 24" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="s2-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z" /></marker></defs><path d="M2 12 H84" /></svg>
    <div><span>FORK BOUNDARY</span><strong>{t('Stage 1 分析 / 状态构建','Stage-1 analysis / state construction')}</strong><small>{t('Ceiling-1.0 与 2.0 从这里分叉','Ceiling-1.0 and 2.0 fork here')}</small></div>
  </div>

  <div class="s2-choice__grid">
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','legacy',{active:active==='legacy'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-256-window/')} aria-current={active==='legacy'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>01 · {t('历史方法 · 旧门槛已取代，数据仍保留','HISTORICAL · GATE SUPERSEDED, DATA RETAINED')}</span><b>{t('历史 Stage 2：每 256 次任务尝试单独检查的硬门槛','Historical Stage 2: a hard gate checked every 256 attempts')}</b></div>
      <p>{t('每 256 次 WebShop 任务尝试被当成一批。只有这一批里至少有 8 个不同任务都能各自完整成功 2 次，模型才允许更新一次参数；不同批之间的成功记录不能累计。这个局部门槛已经被取代，但历史 rollout、成功轨迹和 checkpoint 仍完整保留。','Every 256 WebShop attempts formed one batch. A parameter update was allowed only if at least eight distinct tasks each achieved two exact successes inside that batch; successes could not accumulate across batches. That local gate is superseded, while its rollouts, successes, and checkpoints remain retained evidence.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看历史四臂与归档 →','Open historical arms and archive →')}</strong>
    </a>
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','ceiling',{active:active==='ceiling'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/stage2-ceiling/')} aria-current={active==='ceiling'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>02 · {t('正在运行 / harness 风险复核中','RUNNING / HARNESS UNDER REVIEW')}</span><b>OpenEVO-Ceiling-1.0</b></div>
      <p>{t('每 128 次完整任务尝试形成一轮共同证据，四种可继承状态分别决定是否更新；证据不足时保持原状态（NOOP）。它已经真实产生参数更新，但 3B 暴露出“历史经验文本可能压过当前 Allowed Actions”的接口风险；这条运行线继续保留，不提前改写成暂停。','Every 128 complete attempts form one shared evidence set and four inheritable states decide independently whether to update; insufficient evidence leaves a state unchanged (NOOP). The run has produced real parameter updates, while 3B exposed a risk that historical carrier text can overwhelm live Allowed Actions. This lineage remains intact and is not prematurely labeled paused.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看 Ceiling-1.0 当前策略与运行快照 →','Open Ceiling-1.0 strategy and snapshot →')}</strong>
    </a>
    <a class:list={['s2-choice__card','openevo2',{active:active==='openevo2'}]} href={p('/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/openevo-2-0/')} aria-current={active==='openevo2'?'page':undefined}>
      <div><span>03 · {t('设计中 / 尚未正式启动','DESIGNING / NOT FORMALLY LAUNCHED')}</span><b>OpenEVO 2.0</b></div>
      <p>{t('复用当前 corrected Stage-1 轨迹与封存老师证据，不重采 1,440 条轨迹。第一版聚焦 Context Governor、Memory / Skill / Agent 职责分离、Telemetry v2 和正式运行前 Harness Qualification。','Reuse the current corrected Stage-1 trajectories and sealed teacher evidence without recollecting the 1,440 trajectories. The first version focuses on a Context Governor, Memory/Skill/Agent separation, Telemetry v2, and preformal Harness Qualification.')}</p>
      <strong>{t('查看 OpenEVO 2.0 设计与迁移边界 →','Open the OpenEVO 2.0 design and transition boundary →')}</strong>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.s2-choice{margin:1rem 0 1.4rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:18px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-text) 1.5%,transparent)}
.s2-choice__head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(180px,.45fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:.65rem 1.2rem;padding:.15rem .15rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border)}.s2-choice__head>p{grid-column:1/-1;margin:0;color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .62rem/1.3 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.s2-choice__head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.15rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);letter-spacing:-.035em}.s2-choice__head>span{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.65}
.s2-choice__shared{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 90px minmax(0,1fr);gap:.65rem;align-items:center;margin-top:1rem;padding:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:11px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 3%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__shared>div{min-width:0}.s2-choice__shared span,.s2-choice__shared strong,.s2-choice__shared small{display:block}.s2-choice__shared span{color:var(--color-accent);font:800 .54rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em}.s2-choice__shared strong{margin:.24rem 0;font-size:.78rem}.s2-choice__shared small{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.64rem}.s2-choice__shared svg{width:100%;height:24px}.s2-choice__shared svg path{fill:none;stroke:var(--color-accent);stroke-width:1.7;marker-end:url(#s2-arrow)}.s2-choice__shared svg marker path{fill:var(--color-accent);stroke:none}
.s2-choice__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.8rem;margin-top:1rem}.s2-choice__card{display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:.7rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:13px;color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:none;background:var(--color-bg);transition:border-color .15s ease,transform .15s ease}.s2-choice__card:hover,.s2-choice__card.active{border-color:var(--color-accent);transform:translateY(-1px)}.s2-choice__card div{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.25rem}.s2-choice__card span{font:800 .58rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;letter-spacing:.07em;color:var(--color-text-muted)}.s2-choice__card b{font-size:1rem}.s2-choice__card p{margin:0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.62}.s2-choice__card>strong{margin-top:auto;color:var(--color-accent);font-size:.71rem}.s2-choice__card.legacy{border-style:dashed}.s2-choice__card.legacy.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,#b7791f 5%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__card.ceiling.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 5%,var(--color-bg))}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{border-width:2px}.s2-choice__card.openevo2.active{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--color-accent) 7%,var(--color-bg))}
@media(max-width:900px){.s2-choice__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{grid-column:1/-1}}
@media(max-width:760px){.s2-choice__head,.s2-choice__grid,.s2-choice__shared{grid-template-columns:1fr}.s2-choice__head>p{grid-column:auto}.s2-choice__shared svg{width:30px;transform:rotate(90deg);justify-self:center}.s2-choice__card.openevo2{grid-column:auto}}
</style>
